  "(unauth)_terms_page": {
    "h1": "Terms & Conditions",
    "p": "Please note that these Terms and Conditions were last revised on\n          August 16st, 2025",
    "h2": "General",
    "p_1": "The service lets you use different educational tools, like learning or\n          practicing a language. Mandarino can update, change, pause, improve,\n          or stop any part of the service at any time.",
    "h2_1": "Acceptable Use of the Services",
    "span": "You’re responsible for what you do on our services, including\n            through your account. To keep things safe and enjoyable for\n            everyone, some actions aren’t allowed. When using the services, you\n            must follow our",
    "link": "Community Guidelines.",
    "h2_2": "Registration",
    "p_2": "When you sign up for and use the service, you agree to:",
    "li": "Give Mandarino accurate and up-to-date information about yourself\n            (or your organization).",
    "li_1": "Keep your password and account details private and secure.",
    "li_2": "Update your information if it changes, so it stays correct and\n            current.",
    "li_3": "Take full responsibility for everything that happens under your\n            account.",
    "h2_3": "Content Submission",
    "p_3": "When you upload or share anything on Mandarino (like text, photos,\n          audio, videos or other materials), you give Mandarino permission to\n          use it in many ways. This permission:",
    "li_4": "Is free for Mandarino (you won’t get paid).",
    "li_5": "You can delete any time",
    "li_6": "Allows Mandarino to give others permission to use it too.",
    "span_1": "Please dont upload content that that violates Mandarino's",
    "link_1": "Community Guidelines.",
    "h2_4": "Copyright Infringement Notice",
    "p_4": "If you believe something on our service violates your copyright, you\n          can send us a notice under the DMCA with details about the work, the\n          infringing material, your contact info, and a statement that your\n          claim is made in good faith. Our copyright agent can be reached at",
    "a": "mandarinohello@gmail.com",
    "p_5": ".",
    "p_6": "If your content was removed by mistake, you may send us a\n          counter‑notice with your contact info, a description of the removed\n          content, and a statement that you believe it was removed in error.\n          We’ll forward your counter‑notice to the original claimant, and\n          they’ll have 10 days to let us know if they’re taking legal action. If\n          we don’t hear back, we may restore your content.",
    "h2_5": "License to Apps",
    "p_7": "You can use one copy of the Mandarino app on a device you own or\n          control. You can’t share, copy, or mess with the app’s code (no\n          reverse-engineering, decompiling, etc.). Mandarino owns all rights to\n          the app, including updates and fixes.",
    "h2_6": "Refund Policy",
    "p_8": "You get 30 days to try the product (via Mandarino Free). If you decide\n          to buy (Mandarino Pro), all payments are final. We don’t give refunds\n          or credits for virtual items or unused membership time, unless your\n          local law requires it.",
    "h2_7": "Termination",
    "p_9": "Mandarino can end your access to the service anytime, for any reason,\n          and you won’t be able to keep using it. You can also close your\n          account anytime by following the instructions in the service. Certain\n          sections of these Terms will still apply even after your account is\n          closed.",
    "h2_8": "Trademarks",
    "p_10": "‘Mandarino’ and the related logos, graphics, and trademarks belong to\n          Mandarino or other owners. Using the service doesn’t give you any\n          right to use or copy these names, logos, or trademarks.",
    "h2_9": "Privacy",
    "p_11": "Use of the Service is also governed by our Privacy Policy, a copy of\n          which is located at",
    "link_2": "www.mandarino.io/privacy",
    "p_12": ". By using the Service, you consent to the terms of the Privacy\n          Policy.",
    "h2_10": "Governing Law",
    "p_13": "These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of the Province of\n          Québec and the laws of Canada that apply there, no matter where you\n          are from or where you use the service.",
    "h2_11": "Language",
    "p_14": "This agreement was written in English. If a translation says something\n          different, the English version is what counts."
  },
